+# Implementer Brief 01: Contained Non-Scrolling Layout & Glassmorphic CSS Styling
+
+## Context & Objectives
+In `virtual_dog_walker`, fix the layout and visual presentation of the Home Sanctuary view:
+1. Prevent modal scrollbars: constrain the grass field canvas so `#customizer-modal` never expands or scrolls in the sanctuary view.
+2. Style header actions: `#btn-home-settings` (`⚙️`) and `#btn-home-back` (`← Back`) currently render with default browser white button chrome. Style them with a sleek dark glassmorphic design matching `#btn-close-customizer`.
+3. Style the care action bar: `#home-action-bar` and `#btn-action-feed` (`🍖 Feed`) currently look like raw browser buttons. Style them with an emerald glassmorphic aesthetic.
+
+## Detailed Requirements
+
+### 1. `virtual_dog_walker/src/style.css`
+- **Header Actions Styling**:
+  - Style `.customizer-header-actions`:
+    `display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;`
+  - Style `.customizer-settings` (`#btn-home-settings`):
+    `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 8px; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; width: 32px; height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;`
+    Hover: `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); transform: translateY(-1px);`
+  - Style `.customizer-back` (`#btn-home-back`):
+    `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 8px; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;`
+    Hover: `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); color: #fff;`
+- **Sanctuary Container & Field Canvas Styling**:
+  - Style `#home-view-sanctuary`:
+    `overflow: hidden; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;`
+  - Style `.home-field-preview`:
+    `width: 100%; height: 220px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); background: #3e6b2c; position: relative; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);`
+  - Style `#home-field-canvas`:
+    `width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;`
+- **Care Action Bar & Feed Button Styling**:
+  - Style `#home-action-bar` / `.home-action-bar`:
+    `display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 4px 0 2px 0; width: 100%;`
+  - Style `.btn-action-feed` / `#btn-action-feed`:
+    `background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.16); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45); color: #ecfdf5; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; transition: all 0.2s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); font-family: inherit;`
+    Hover: `background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.26); border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.65); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);`
+    Active: `transform: translateY(0);`
+    Disabled: `opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; box-shadow: none;`
+
+### 2. `virtual_dog_walker/src/ui/social_hud.js`
+- Ensure the `#home-field-canvas` element inside `#home-view-sanctuary` is rendered with `width="340"` and `height="220"`.
+- Verify `#btn-home-settings` has `class="customizer-settings"` and `#btn-home-back` has `class="customizer-back"`.
+
+## Verification
+Run:
+`cd virtual_dog_walker && python3 -m unittest test/test_home_menu.py`
+Suite must pass 100%.
+
+

